{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-logging-design","title":"结构化日志设计","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/structured-logging-design","wordCount":1643,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"log-levels-taxonomy","title":"日志级别与分类体系","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/log-levels-taxonomy","wordCount":1586,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"logging-standards-conventions","title":"日志标准与规范","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/logging-standards-conventions","wordCount":1254,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础\n\n本章建立日志工程的设计基础：结构化日志为什么优于自由文本、级别体系如何指导信噪比控制、以及组织级标准如何确保跨服务一致性。这三篇文档形成递进关系——先理解单条日志应该长什么样，再理解级别如何决定它是否该被发出，最后理解团队如何对齐约定。掌握这些基础后，后续章节的管道设计和查询模式才有稳固的根基。\n"}